    "long_instructions": "## Exploring Paragraphs & Line Breaks\r\n\r\nIn this level, we'll use AI Tutor to help us understand paragraph tags and line breaks, and generate new content for our webpage.\r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n1) Ask AI Tutor to explain how paragraph tags work in HTML\r\n    - You can send AI Tutor a message directly, or highlight the code and select \"Add to AI Tutor\"\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to explain how horizontal line `<hr />` tags work in HTML\r\n2) Ask AI Tutor to add a new holiday to this page. Use specific language, like \"paragraph tag\" or `<p>` or `<hr />`, to make sure AI follows your vision.\r\n\r\nOnce you've added your own content: press the Continue button!\r\n\r\n\r\n",
