          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <body>\n    <h1>Holidays Around the World</h1>\n\n    <p>Diwali is the Hindu festival of lights, celebrated across India and many parts of the world.</p>\n    <p>Families light oil lamps called diyas, share sweets, and set off fireworks to mark the victory of light over darkness.</p>\n\t\n  \t<hr />\n\n    <p>Lunar New Year is celebrated in many East and Southeast Asian cultures, including Chinese, Vietnamese, and Korean communities.</p>\n    <p>Traditions include family gatherings, parades with dragon and lion dances, and giving red envelopes as gifts.</p>\n\n  \t<hr />\n\n    <p>Carnival is a festive season celebrated before Lent in many countries, most famously in Brazil, Trinidad, and Italy.</p>\n    <p>It is known for its elaborate costumes, music, dancing, and large street parades.</p>\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
